Features
1. User Authentication - User can create accounts and securely log in to access the platform.
2. Profile Management – Users can create, edit, and manage their personal profiles.
3. Post Sharing – Users can upload images and share posts with captions.
4. News Feed – Users can view posts shared by other users in a feed.
5. Like and Comment – Users can interact with posts through likes and comments.
6. Follow and Unfollow – Users can follow or unfollow other users anytime.
7. Search Feature – Users can search for other users by username.
8. Notifications – Users receive updates about likes, comments, and follows.
9. Edit and Delete Posts – Users can modify or remove their own posts.
10. Dark and Light Mode – Users can switch themes for better viewing experience.
11. Responsive Design – The website works smoothly on mobile and desktop devices.
12. Secure Authentication – User data is protected through secure login systems.
13. Admin Panel – Admin can manage users and monitor website activities.
